                "content": "<div class=\"react-rack\"><div class=\"rack-label\">SHARED MEMORY FABRIC</div><div class=\"rack-unit switch\"><b>High-speed network switch</b><span>\u2195 200\u2013800 Gb/s links</span></div><div class=\"fabric\">\u2195&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\u2195&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\u2195&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\u2195</div><div class=\"agents\"><div class=\"rack-unit agent\">\ud83e\udde0 ReAct agent 01</div><div class=\"rack-unit agent\">\ud83e\udde0 ReAct agent 02</div><div class=\"rack-unit agent\">\ud83e\udde0 ReAct agent 03</div><div class=\"rack-unit agent\">\ud83e\udde0 ReAct agent 04</div></div><div class=\"fabric\">\u2195&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; pooled KV state &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\u2195</div><div class=\"rack-unit cxl\"><b>CXL pooled memory</b><span>shared cache and agent state</span></div><div class=\"method\"><b>Fair comparison</b><br>One serving system per run<br>Same workload and duration<br>Overlay by elapsed seconds</div></div><style>.react-rack{height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:16px;border:2px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0f172a,#020617);color:#e2e8f0;font:14px Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rack-label{text-align:center;color:#67e8f9;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;margin:2px 0 14px}.rack-unit{border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin:7px 0;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 14px #0008}.rack-unit span{display:block;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}.switch{border:1px solid #60a5fa;background:#172554}.agent{border:1px solid #22d3ee;background:#064e52}.cxl{border:1px solid #a78bfa;background:#312e81}.fabric{text-align:center;color:#38bdf8;font-size:20px;line-height:24px}.method{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-top:1px solid #334155;line-height:1.55;color:#cbd5e1}.method b{color:#f8fafc}</style>",
